    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d439">

                <pb facs="0578" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg464"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.93/58: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Herrick</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract—Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-06-19T15:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 19, 1924—3
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 19—2 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>308. Your telegram no. 184 of June 14.<anchor n="88" xml:id="d439-f1"/> I was
                    informed yesterday at the Foreign Office by the Chief of the Asiatic Bureau that
                    the French Government would definitely be opposed to changing its Legation in
                    China to an Embassy. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herrick</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
